`cargo test --locked -p taskdeck-core --test sec_probe f_overlay` panics with 'attempt to subtract with overflow' at crates/taskdeck-core/src/overlay.rs:64. In release it passes (wraps). Today's read_overlay always calls Overlay::sealed, which clamps start and end, so this only bites a caller that uses the derived Deserialize directly.
